  "user_request_original": "Optimize a 20-layer alternating HfO2/SiO2 dielectric stack on fused silica substrate with air incidence. Initialize all 20 layer thicknesses using Round 2 best candidate values: [108.65847125490973, 56.50615602255855, 115.64930917851245, 58.85922470466126, 122.67024817006853, 61.23228869203895, 130.03615377773906, 61.40177404898979, 145.55690061479294, 62.93928341891642, 152.05974953162786, 66.95082490418632, 130.761026868516, 114.91028575947755, 115.44156456389337, 130.10712878278568, 120.17238315060555, 114.78368439440294, 52.688595724793295, 53.37932410883822] nm. Apply continuous-only gradient thickness optimizer with learning rate 1e-4. Use soft-boundary clipping at ±2% of initialization values instead of hard bounds. Evaluate dual-band objectives: mean transmittance maximization in 1000-1700 nm, mean reflectance maximization in 300-450 nm. Disable any integer-rounding post-processing. Monitor tightest_margin throughout optimization to ensure sub-wavelength phase accuracy is preserved across all 20 layers. Canonical user controls: wavelength intervals 300-450 nm, 1000-1700 nm. soft objectives: high transmission in 1000-1700 nm; high reflection in 300-450 nm. behaviors to suppress or avoid: reflection in 1000-1700 nm; transmission in 300-450 nm. manufacturing constraints: Maximum total layer count of 30.",
  "normalized_request_english": "Optimize the 20 explicitly initialized continuous layer thicknesses of an alternating HfO2/SiO2 dielectric stack on fused silica under normal air incidence. Maximize mean transmittance across 1000-1700 nm and maximize mean reflectance across 300-450 nm simultaneously, using a continuous gradient optimizer with learning rate 1e-4, minimal quantization for solver stability, and soft-boundary clipping constrained to ±2% of the provided initialization values.",
